That gives the gym a different role from mere exercise: $\text{training}
\quad \Longrightarrow \quad
\text{mind space}
+
\text{self-directed goals}.$ This is the local mechanism. The body is involved, but the claim is not only about the body. The gym is a place where the speaker can step outside the demands of the office and still remain in a disciplined, goal-seeking mode.

