The ratio is easy to write: $\begin{aligned}
T_{\mathrm{total}}   &= 4\ \text{hours},\\
T_{\mathrm{sharpen}} &= 3\ \text{hours},\\
T_{\mathrm{chop}}    &= 1\ \text{hour}.\end{aligned}$ So the preparation share is: $\frac{T_{\mathrm{sharpen}}}{T_{\mathrm{total}}}
=
\frac{3}{4}.$

